      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mnamo siku ya ishirini na moja, mwezi wa saba mwaka huohuo, neno la Mwenyezi-Mungu lilimjia nabii Hagai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwambia Hagai aongee na mkuu wa Yuda, Zerubabeli mwana wa Shealtieli, kuhani mkuu Yoshua mwana wa Yehosadaki na watu wote waliorudi kutoka uhamishoni awaambie hivi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Ezra 3:12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Je, kuna yeyote kati yenu asiyekumbuka jinsi hekalu hili lilivyokuwa la fahari? Sasa mnalionaje? Bila shaka sasa mnaliona kama si kitu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata hivyo, usife moyo, ewe Zerubabeli. Jipe moyo, kuhani mkuu Yoshua mwana wa Yehosadaki. Jipeni moyo nanyi watu wote wa nchi hii. Fanyeni kazi, maana mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi, nipo pamoja nanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Kut 29:45-46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mlipotoka Misri niliwaahidi kwamba daima nitakuwa pamoja nanyi. Basi, ningali pamoja nanyi, kwa hiyo, msiogope kitu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
